# English Learning Tool — 每日题目预生成 job（oneshot，由 timer 触发）
[Unit]
Description=English Learning daily prefetch job

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/english-learning/app/apps/api
EnvironmentFile=/etc/english-learning/env
ExecStart=/opt/english-learning/app/apps/api/node_modules/.bin/tsx src/jobs/daily-prefetch.ts
